  "title": "Hiking in the Raku Lake",
  "date": "2026-06-06T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Hiking in the Raku Lake\n\nIt has been two years since I passed by the rock of Tondi. Somehow, it was my very first sightseeing about Tallinn when I searched online.\n\nTondi\n\nAfter tram 3 I turned to bus 57 got to Raku station. The lake is about 1 km away.\n\nSand beach\n\nThe weather is amazing, even gives a little Swissland feeling.\n\nSelfie\n\nswan and baby swan",
